            : '💡 **AI Tutor Hint (Binary Search Tree):**\n\n1. **Balance Property**: Use AVL tree rotations to maintain O(log n) height.\n2. **Memory Safety**: Use post-order traversal when freeing nodes to prevent memory leaks.'
